18	precon	GMP - write scopes / front ends	11	t	\N	t
19	precon	GMP - distribute packages / supplements	12	f	\N	t
20	precon	GMP - scope review meetings	13	f	\N	t
21	precon	GMP - final compilation / review	14	t	\N	t
22	precon	Client meetings	15	t	\N	t
23	precon	Other	16	t	\N	t
